    "text": "By Aaron Williams ,\n7 hours ago Jett Harrison of St. Joseph's Prep (Philadelphia, Pa.) announced his commitment to Ohio State on Wednesday via social media. Though Harrison can't make it official until next year, the announcement means he will likely follow in the footsteps of brother Marvin Harrison Jr., who had a stellar three-year career in Columbus. Read full article",
